{"title":"Career Roadmap · BI Analyst","role":"BI Analyst","summary":"A Business Intelligence (BI) Analyst transforms organizational data into dashboards, reports, KPIs, trends, and actionable insights that support business decisions.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Data Science / Analytics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Business Intelligence (BI) Analyst transforms organizational data into dashboards, reports, KPIs, trends, and actionable insights that support business decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business data analysis"},{"text":"SQL querying"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Dashboard development"},{"text":"KPI definition"},{"text":"Report automation"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Business performance monitoring"},{"text":"Stakeholder reporting"},{"text":"Self-service analytics"},{"text":"Data storytelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Data Science/Analytics student, the ideal pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Data Science/Analytics","SQL + Power BI + Statistics + Data Modelling","BI Analyst","Senior BI Analyst","BI/Analytics Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Sc + SQL + Excel + Power BI + Python + statistics + BI projects"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"BI Analyst / Reporting Analyst / Business Analyst"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior BI Analyst / BI Developer / Analytics Specialist"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"BI Lead / Analytics Manager / BI Architect / Head of Analytics"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Sc","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Data Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programming fundamentals"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Database fundamentals"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how organizational data moves from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Source","Database","Transformation","Analysis","Dashboard"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — BI Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced SQL"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data transformation"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"KPI development"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"Business statistics"},{"text":"Start developing dashboards using realistic business datasets."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Advanced BI & Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced DAX"},{"text":"Star schema"},{"text":"Dimensional modelling"},{"text":"ETL/ELT concepts"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"Cloud analytics"},{"text":"Dashboard performance optimization"},{"text":"Row-level security"},{"text":"Business storytelling"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Advanced analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"If pursuing a 4-year Honours/Research program, use the additional year for a business intelligence, analytics engineering or data warehousing project."}]},{"heading":"Core Technical Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills to Develop"],"rows":[[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Advanced querying, joins, CTEs, window functions"}],[{"text":"BI"},{"text":"Power BI / Tableau"}],[{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Measures, calculated columns, filter context"}],[{"text":"Data Modelling"},{"text":"Star schema, dimensions, facts"}],[{"text":"ETL"},{"text":"Power Query, transformation pipelines"}],[{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Descriptive/inferential statistics"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas, NumPy, visualization"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced formulas, Pivot Tables, Power Query"}],[{"text":"Visualization"},{"text":"KPI and executive dashboard design"}],[{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP analytics fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Data Warehousing"},{"text":"OLAP, dimensional modelling"}],[{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Security, access, data quality"}]]}]},{"heading":"SQL — Core BI Skill","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BI Analyst should be highly proficient in SQL."},{"type":"h","text":"Core"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"UNION"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Ranking"},{"text":"Running totals"},{"text":"Moving averages"},{"text":"Lag/Lead"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"Conditional aggregation"},{"text":"Query optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to answer:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is monthly revenue?"},{"text":"Which products have declining margins?"},{"text":"Which customers generate the most value?"},{"text":"Which region is underperforming?"},{"text":"What is customer retention by cohort?"}]}]},{"heading":"Power BI & DAX","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this role, Power BI should be one of the student's strongest tools."},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data sources"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Measures"},{"text":"Calculated columns"},{"text":"Hierarchies"},{"text":"Drill-through"},{"text":"Bookmarks"},{"text":"Tooltips"},{"text":"Row-level security"},{"text":"Dashboard optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"DAX"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CALCULATE"},{"text":"FILTER"},{"text":"SUMX"},{"text":"AVERAGEX"},{"text":"COUNTROWS"},{"text":"DISTINCTCOUNT"},{"text":"ALL"},{"text":"ALLEXCEPT"},{"text":"VALUES"},{"text":"DATE functions"},{"text":"Time intelligence"},{"text":"Context transition"},{"text":"The student should understand the difference between row context and filter context."}]}]},{"heading":"Data Modelling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BI Analyst should not simply import spreadsheets into Power BI."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dimensional Modelling"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fact tables"},{"text":"Dimension tables"},{"text":"Star schema"},{"text":"Snowflake schema"},{"text":"Primary keys"},{"text":"Foreign keys"},{"text":"Surrogate keys"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Granularity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Date Dimension"},{"text":"│"},{"text":"Customer ─────── Sales Fact ───── Product"},{"text":"│"},{"text":"Geography"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how good modelling improves:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Reusability"},{"text":"Maintainability"},{"text":"Reporting consistency"}]}]},{"heading":"Excel & Data Preparation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Pivot Charts"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power Pivot"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing values"},{"text":"Duplicate records"},{"text":"Inconsistent categories"},{"text":"Date normalization"},{"text":"Outlier detection"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Data quality checks"}]}]},{"heading":"Python for BI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Python is not al