xt":"Star-schema understanding"},{"text":"Data warehousing fundamentals"},{"text":"Strong data visualization"},{"text":"Business KPI knowledge"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Python/pandas"},{"text":"Basic cloud analytics"},{"text":"ETL/ELT understanding"},{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"4–5 professional BI projects"},{"text":"At least one BI/data internship"},{"text":"A polished Power BI portfolio"},{"text":"Strong presentation and stakeholder communication skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For B.Sc Data Science/Analytics → BI Analyst, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not become only a dashboard creator. Become a BI professional who understands data engineering, modelling, analytics, business KPIs and decision-making."},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Data Science/Analytics","SQL + Power BI + DAX + Data Modelling","BI Analyst","Senior BI Analyst","BI/Analytics Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"with Python, cloud data platforms, modern data warehouses, AI-powered BI and decision intelligence providing a strong future-ready advantage."}]}]}